    {
      "id": 168,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        -280,
        4420
      ],
      "size": [
        370,
        230
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 0,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Masked-audio lip-sync",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**Masked-audio music video** - the strongest lip-sync H3 can do.\n\nEach clip's exact slice of the song is encoded with the audio VAE and written straight into the H3 audio latent, protected from denoising (mask 0). The video is generated against the real, frozen vocal - lip-sync is enforced by the model, not requested by the prompt.\n\n- The song is **not** connected to `ref_audio` (that is on purpose).\n- The **vocal stem** (AudioSeparation) is injected so instruments don't mask the voice; the final soundtrack is still the full mix via Scenes Join `replace_audio`.\n- The writer's `audio_mode` is set to *Masked latent*, so the prompts reference the protected master-song audio instead of `<Audio 1>`.\n- `clip_starts` from the writer gives every clip its exact offset in the master song.\n\nNeeds ComfyUI-H3-Motion-Context-MultiRef and audio-separation-nodes-comfyui."
      ]
    },
